<title>UK: Bt in alliance with Portugal Telecom, MCI.</title>
<headline>Bt in alliance with Portugal Telecom, MCI.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>British Telcommunications Plc said it formed a strategic alliance with MCI Communications Corp and Portugal Telecom SA to gain a strong position in fast growing markets in Portugal and Latin America.</p>
<p>Under the alliance's terms, BT will take a one percent stake in Portugal Telecom, while MCI will take 0.5 percent.</p>
</text>
